<%- include('partials/head') %>
<style>
  /* Home page extends the shared tokens in style.css — no new palette here. */

  a { text-decoration: none; }

  /* ── Public nav ─────────────────────────────────────── */

  .home-nav {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 100;
    background: rgba(12, 8, 32, 0.68);
    backdrop-filter: blur(14px) saturate(140%);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
  }
  .home-nav-inner {
    max-width: 1080px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 12px 20px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }
  .home-nav-right { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .home-nav-links { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 28px; flex: 1; justify-content: center; }
  .home-nav-links a { color: var(--text-dim); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; }
  .home-nav-links a:hover { color: var(--text); }
  .home-nav-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .home-nav-actions .btn { width: auto; padding: 9px 16px; font-size: 13.5px; }
  .home-nav-toggle {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 36px; height: 36px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--bg-raised);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size: 15px;
    cursor: pointer;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .home-nav-inner .brand { flex-shrink: 0; }
  .home-mobile-menu {
    display: none;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
    padding: 10px 20px 18px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
  }
  .home-mobile-menu.open { display: flex; }
  .home-mobile-menu a:not(.btn) {
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size: 14.5px;
    font-weight: 500;
    padding: 11px 4px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
  }
  .home-mobile-menu a:not(.btn):last-of-type { border-bottom: none; }
  .home-mobile-menu .btn { margin-top: 10px; width: 100%; }

  @media (min-width: 861px) {
    .home-nav-toggle { display: none; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .home-nav-links { display: none; }
    .home-nav-brand-text {
      font-size: 15px;
      white-space: nowrap;
      overflow: hidden;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
      max-width: 34vw;
    }
    .home-nav-actions { display: none; }
  }

  /* ── Hero ───────────────────────────────────────────── */

  .home-hero-wrap { position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .home-hero-bg {
    position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 0;
    opacity: 0.55; pointer-events: none;
  }
  .home-hero-bg path { fill: none; stroke-width: 1.4; }

  .home-hero { position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 72px 20px 44px; text-align: center; }
  .home-hero-pill {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
    font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-dim);
    background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    padding: 7px 14px; border-radius: 99px; margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .home-hero-pill .pulse { width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--cool); flex-shrink: 0; }
  .home-hero h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    line-height: 1.18;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .home-hero h1 .rotate {
    background: var(--accent-grad);
    -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text;
    color: transparent; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    display: inline-block; min-width: 1ch; transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
  }
  .home-hero p { font-size: 15.5px; max-width: 46ch; margin: 0 auto 30px; }
  .home-hero-actions { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 40px; }
  .home-hero-actions .btn { width: auto; padding: 13px 24px; border-radius: 99px; }
  .home-hero-actions .btn-secondary { border-radius: 99px; }

  .home-hero-stats { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 48px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .home-hero-stats .stat .value { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .home-hero-stats .stat .label { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-faint); margin-top: 2px; }

  /* ── Sections ───────────────────────────────────────── */

  .home-section { max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 52px 20px; }
  .home-section-head { max-width: 52ch; margin-bottom: 30px; }
  .home-section-head h2 { font-size: 1.6rem; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .home-section-head p { font-size: 14px; margin: 0; }
  .home-section-alt { background: var(--bg-raised); border-top: 1px solid var(--border-soft); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft); }

  /* ── Features ───────────────────────────────────────── */

  .home-features { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0 44px; }
  .home-feature { padding: 20px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft); }
  .home-feature h3 { font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 5px; }
  .home-feature p { font-size: 13.5px; margin: 0; }

  /* ── Steps ──────────────────────────────────────────── */

  .home-steps { max-width: 640px; }
  .home-step { display: flex; gap: 18px; padding: 18px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft); }
  .home-step:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .home-step .num { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; background: var(--accent-grad); -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; font-size: 20px; width: 32px; flex-shrink: 0; padding-top: 2px; }
  .home-step h3 { font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .home-step p { font-size: 13.5px; margin: 0; }

  /* ── Bots ───────────────────────────────────────────── */

  .home-bot-card { position: relative; }
  .home-bot-card .bot-cost { position: absolute; top: 18px; right: 18px; margin: 0; }

  /* ── CTA ────────────────────────────────────────────── */

  .home-cta {
    max-width: 1080px;
    margin: 0 auto 60px;
    padding: 40px 32px;
    background:
      linear-gradient(rgba(20, 15, 38, 0.88), rgba(20, 15, 38, 0.88)) padding-box,
      var(--accent-grad) border-box;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(162, 86, 234, 0.18);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 24px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .home-cta h2 { font-size: 1.35rem; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .home-cta p { font-size: 13.5px; margin: 0; }
  .home-cta .btn { width: auto; padding: 12px 22px; flex-shrink: 0; }

  /* ── Footer ─────────────────────────────────────────── */

  .home-footer { max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 20px 0; }
  .home-footer-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr 1fr 1.2fr; gap: 24px; padding-bottom: 30px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft); }
  .home-footer-grid h4 { font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--text-faint); margin-bottom: 14px; font-weight: 600; }
  .home-footer-links { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
  .home-footer-links a { color: var(--text-dim); font-size: 13.5px; }
  .home-footer-links a:hover { color: var(--text); }
  .home-footer-about p { font-size: 13.5px; max-width: 34ch; }

  /* ── Motion: one entrance moment for the hero, nothing else ── */

  .home-hero-pill, .home-hero h1, .home-hero p, .home-hero-actions, .home-hero-stats {
    opacity: 0; animation: home-rise 0.5s ease-out forwards;
  }
  .home-hero h1 { animation-delay: 0.06s; }
  .home-hero p { animation-delay: 0.12s; }
  .home-hero-actions { animation-delay: 0.18s; }
  .home-hero-stats { animation-delay: 0.24s; }
  @keyframes home-rise { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .home-hero h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
    .home-hero-stats { gap: 30px; }
    .home-features { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .card-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .pricing-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .home-footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  }
</style>

<div class="home-hero-wrap">
  <svg class="home-hero-bg" viewBox="0 0 1080 640" preserveAspectRatio="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
    <path d="M-50 420 C 200 360, 380 480, 560 400 S 900 320, 1130 380" stroke="var(--cool)" opacity="0.35"/>
    <path d="M-50 470 C 220 520, 420 380, 640 460 S 940 440, 1130 500" stroke="var(--accent)" opacity="0.28"/>
    <path d="M-50 540 C 260 500, 460 600, 700 540 S 980 560, 1130 600" stroke="var(--bot-3)" opacity="0.22"/>
  </svg>

  <!-- Public nav -->
  <nav class="home-nav">
    <div class="home-nav-inner">
      <a href="/" class="brand"><img src="/images/logo.jpg" alt="<%= siteName %> logo" class="brand-mark-img"><span class="home-nav-brand-text"><%= siteName %><span class="dot">.</span></span></a>
      <div class="home-nav-links">
        <a href="#features">Features</a>
        <a href="#how-it-works">How it works</a>
        <a href="#bots">Bots</a>
        <a href="#pricing">Pricing</a>
        <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
      </div>
      <div class="home-nav-right">
        <div class="home-nav-actions">
          <a href="/login" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm">Log in</a>
          <a href="/register" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Sign up</a>
        </div>
        <button class="home-nav-toggle" id="homeNavToggle" aria-label="Menu" aria-expanded="false">☰</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="home-mobile-menu" id="homeMobileMenu">
      <a href="#features">Features</a>
      <a href="#how-it-works">How it works</a>
      <a href="#bots">Bots</a>
      <a href="#pricing">Pricing</a>
      <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
      <a href="/login">Log in</a>
      <a href="/register" class="btn btn-primary">Sign up</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <header class="home-hero">
    <div class="home-hero-pill">
      <span class="pulse"></span>
      <% if (stats.users > 0) { %>Trusted by <%= stats.users.toLocaleString() %>+ builders<% } else { %><%= bots.length %> WhatsApp bots ready to deploy<% } %>
    </div>
    <h1>Deploy your <span class="rotate" id="heroRotate"><%= bots.length ? bots[0].name : siteName %></span><br>in seconds</h1>
    <p>
      Pick a bot, paste your WhatsApp session, and <%= siteName %> builds and hosts it for you.
      Coins cover the cost — no monthly seat, no server to manage.
    </p>
    <div class="home-hero-actions">
      <a href="/register" class="btn btn-primary">Create free account →</a>
      <a href="#how-it-works" class="btn btn-secondary">See how it works</a>
    </div>
    <div class="home-hero-stats">
      <div class="stat"><div class="value" id="userCount" data-target="<%= stats.users %>">0</div><div class="label">Verified builders</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="value" id="botCount" data-target="<%= stats.activeDeployments %>">0</div><div class="label">Bots running now</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="value" id="catalogCount" data-target="<%= bots.length %>">0</div><div class="label">Bots in catalog</div></div>
    </div>
  </header>
</div>

<!-- Features -->
<section id="features" class="home-section home-section-alt">
  <div class="home-section-head">
    <h2>Why builders use <%= siteName %></h2>
    <p>Everything a bot needs to stay online, without the parts you'd rather not run yourself.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card-grid">
    <div class="info-card c1">
      <div class="icon">⚡</div>
      <h3>Instant deployment</h3>
      <p>Paste your session ID and it's live in seconds — no server administration knowledge required.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="info-card c2">
      <div class="icon">🪙</div>
      <h3>Coin-based deploys</h3>
      <p>Coins cover the deploy and its upkeep, not a monthly seat. Top up when you actually need to.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="info-card c3">
      <div class="icon">🤝</div>
      <h3>Referrals pay you back</h3>
      <p>Invite a friend and you both earn bonus coins once they verify their account.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="info-card c4">
      <div class="icon">🛡️</div>
      <h3>Built for uptime</h3>
      <p>We handle restarts, builds, and crashes on our infrastructure. If a bot goes down, it comes back.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="info-card c1">
      <div class="icon">📊</div>
      <h3>One dashboard</h3>
      <p>Every bot you run, its status, and your coin balance — in a single place.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="info-card c2">
      <div class="icon">💬</div>
      <h3>Real support</h3>
      <p>Questions or issues reach an actual person at <%= supportEmail %>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- How it works -->
<section id="how-it-works" class="home-section">
  <div class="home-section-head">
    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <p>Four steps between signing up and a bot that's actually running.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="home-steps">
    <div class="home-step">
      <div class="num">01</div>
      <div><h3>Create an account</h3><p>Sign up free and verify your email in a few seconds.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="home-step">
      <div class="num">02</div>
      <div><h3>Get starter coins</h3><p>New accounts start with free coins, plus more from referrals.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="home-step">
      <div class="num">03</div>
      <div><h3>Deploy a bot</h3><p>Pick a bot, connect your session, and confirm the deploy in coins.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="home-step">
      <div class="num">04</div>
      <div><h3>Keep it running</h3><p>Track status, restarts, and coin balance from your dashboard.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Available bots -->
<section id="bots" class="home-section">
  <div class="home-section-head">
    <h2>Available bots (<%= bots.length %>)</h2>
    <p>Each one deploys the same way — pick it, connect a session, done.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="bot-grid">
    <% bots.forEach(function(bot) { %>
    <a href="/register" class="bot-card home-bot-card">
      <div class="bot-icon <%= bot.cssClass %>"><%= bot.initial %></div>
      <h3><%= bot.name %></h3>
      <p class="tagline"><%= bot.tagline %></p>
      <span class="bot-cost">🪙 <%= bot.costCoins %> JC</span>
    </a>
    <% }) %>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Pricing -->
<section id="pricing" class="home-section home-section-alt">
  <div class="home-section-head">
    <h2>Simple, coin-based pricing</h2>
    <p>No subscriptions — pay in coins, earn coins daily and through referrals, top up only when you need to.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="pricing-grid">
    <div class="price-card">
      <span class="badge">Standard</span>
      <h3>Free</h3>
      <p class="tagline">What every account gets, no strings attached.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Up to <%= settings.maxBotsPerUser %> bot slots</li>
        <li><%= settings.deployCostCoins %> JC to deploy a bot</li>
        <li><%= settings.renewalCostCoins %> JC every <%= settings.renewalPeriodHours %>h to keep it running</li>
        <li><%= settings.dailyClaimCoins %> JC free every day</li>
        <li><%= settings.referralBonusCoins %> JC for you and your friend, per referral</li>
      </ul>
      <a href="/register" class="btn btn-secondary">Create my account</a>
    </div>
    <div class="price-card featured">
      <span class="badge">Premium</span>
      <h3>Premium</h3>
      <p class="tagline">More room to run, cheaper to keep running.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Up to <%= settings.maxBotsPerUser + settings.premiumBonusSlots %> bot slots (+<%= settings.premiumBonusSlots %>)</li>
        <li><%= settings.deployCostCoins %> JC to deploy a bot</li>
        <li><%= settings.premiumRenewalCostCoins %> JC every <%= settings.renewalPeriodHours %>h — cheaper than standard</li>
        <li><%= settings.dailyClaimCoins %> JC free every day</li>
        <li><%= settings.referralBonusCoins %> JC for you and your friend, per referral</li>
      </ul>
      <a href="mailto:<%= supportEmail %>" class="btn btn-primary">Contact us to upgrade</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FAQ -->
<section id="faq" class="home-section">
  <div class="home-section-head">
    <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
    <p>Got questions? Here's what people usually ask.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="max-width:720px">
    <details class="faq-item" open>
      <summary>What can I deploy on <%= siteName %>?</summary>
      <p>WhatsApp bots from our catalog — <%= bots.map(function(b){ return b.name; }).join(', ') %>. Each one deploys the same way: pick it, paste your session, done.</p>
    </details>
    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>How does the coin system work?</summary>
      <p>New accounts start with free coins. You can also claim <%= settings.dailyClaimCoins %> JC every <%= settings.dailyClaimPeriodHours %>h for free, and earn <%= settings.referralBonusCoins %> JC every time someone you refer verifies their account. Deploying costs <%= settings.deployCostCoins %> JC, and keeping a bot running costs <%= settings.renewalCostCoins %> JC every <%= settings.renewalPeriodHours %>h.</p>
    </details>
    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>What happens if my coins run out?</summary>
      <p>Your bot is paused, not deleted. Top up or claim free coins, then restart it from My Bots whenever you're ready — nothing is lost.</p>
    </details>
    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>Is there a free tier?</summary>
      <p>Yes — every account starts with free coins, plus a daily free claim. You can run a bot without ever paying anything, as long as you keep it topped up through claims and referrals.</p>
    </details>
    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>What does Premium change?</summary>
      <p>More bot slots and a cheaper renewal rate. Everything else — deploy cost, daily claim, referrals — stays the same.</p>
    </details>
    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>Can I change my bot after deploying it?</summary>
      <p>Yes. From My Bots you can update your session, restart, redeploy the latest code, stop, resume, or delete a bot at any time.</p>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<div class="home-cta">
  <div>
    <h2>Your bot could be live in five minutes</h2>
    <p>Free to sign up, starter coins included, no card required.</p>
  </div>
  <a href="/register" class="btn btn-primary">Create my account</a>
</div>

<!-- Footer -->
<footer class="home-footer">
  <div class="home-footer-grid">
    <div class="home-footer-about">
      <div class="brand" style="margin-bottom:12px"><img src="/images/logo.jpg" alt="<%= siteName %> logo" class="brand-mark-img"><%= siteName %><span class="dot">.</span></div>
      <p>Deploy WhatsApp bots to hosted infrastructure in minutes — no server management required.</p>
      <div class="social-row">
        <a href="#" aria-label="WhatsApp" title="Add your link">
